# Frontend Environment Variables Template for JeevanVaani
# In local development, the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:5000.
# In production (e.g. Vercel, Netlify), set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your backend API URL if not served on same domain.

# Optional: URL to backend API (e.g., https://jeevanvani-api.onrender.com/api)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
